flowchart LR
  H[Human user] --> W[Next.js console]
  X[External agent] --> MCP[MCP endpoint]
  W --> API[FastAPI application and policy checks]
  MCP --> API
  API --> AUTH[Supabase Auth]
  API --> CP[Supabase Postgres control plane and durable jobs]
  API --> G[(FalkorDB graph per workspace)]
  JOB[Background worker] --> CP
  JOB --> G
  API --> LLM[LLM provider]
  JOB --> LLM
  API -->|propose only| ACT[Sandbox action adapter]
  H -->|approve or reject| API
  ACT -->|outcome| G
  G -->|sources, memory, tasks, traces, decisions| API

  subgraph Governing_rules
    ID[Server-derived tenant and agent identity]
    ACL[Per-node, edge, source and history access checks]
    TRUST[Provenance and trust review]
    DEL[Forgetting blocks derived live content and active runs]
  end
  API -.-> ID
  API -.-> ACL
  API -.-> TRUST
  API -.-> DEL
